  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Tongan Media Sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The investment is delivered by the Australian Broadcasting Corporation. The program focuses on two elements 1) strengthening the Media Association of Tonga through organisational capacity development and funding for press club addresses and 2) supporting journalists to produce quality public interest content through media fellowships and cadetships. 

The investment complements the regional PACMAS program, which aims to achieve a more professional, resilient, and diverse Pacific media sector in support of Pacific people&#x2019;s access to public interest media content.</narrative>
  </description>
